[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11760.469, "timestamp": "03:16:00", "text": "我该怎么办？我需要总结一下。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11762.91, "timestamp": "03:16:02", "text": "现在。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11766.67, "timestamp": "03:16:06", "text": "嗯，好的，我们可以结束了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11769.71, "timestamp": "03:16:09", "text": "这里。好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11781.269, "timestamp": "03:16:21", "text": "大概是“哦不，我刚才点了什么？”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11784.469, "timestamp": "03:16:24", "text": "好吧，我没有点击。谢天谢地。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11786.63, "timestamp": "03:16:26", "text": "是的，我们会继续努力奋斗。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11791.19, "timestamp": "03:16:31", "text": "大概哪天会直播的，啊，我刚才是不是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11794.269, "timestamp": "03:16:34", "text": "关闭 YouTube？我的天啊。等等，等等，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11799.51, "timestamp": "03:16:39", "text": "等等，不，不，不，不，不，不，不。我 我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11802.07, "timestamp": "03:16:42", "text": "恐慌导致某些东西关闭。我不应该"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11806.08, "timestamp": "03:16:46", "text": "所以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11807.229, "timestamp": "03:16:47", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11811.79, "timestamp": "03:16:51", "text": "嗯，所以，我们会做的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11814.429, "timestamp": "03:16:54", "text": "嗯，就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11819.11, "timestamp": "03:16:59", "text": "呃，我该怎么称呼它呢？嗯，我们会的。"}]